  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_6151.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este martes ha estado dedicado a la gente menuda en las fiestas del barrio del tossalet, en Onda, con juegos infantiles, domino, tres en raya, carreras o aros, patrocinados por la ASOCIACI&Oacute;N DISADI-ONDA.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6135.jpg\" alt=\"img_6135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6136.jpg\" alt=\"img_6136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6137.jpg\" alt=\"img_6137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6138.jpg\" alt=\"img_6138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6139.jpg\" alt=\"img_6139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6140.jpg\" alt=\"img_6140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6141.jpg\" alt=\"img_6141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6142.jpg\" alt=\"img_6142\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jocsinfantilsfestestossalet13/img_6143.jpg\" alt=\"img_6143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d47154